[09:47.88]authentic [ɔːˈθentɪk]a. 真的，真正的；可靠的，可信的； 真迹的，原作的 例 The young customers are inclined to buy authentic products. 搭 authentic text 正本 / authentic work 真迹
[10:03.24]appraise [əˈpreɪz]vt. 评价，评估；估价；评定 例 How would your present employer appraise you? That would push down final demand further.
[10:16.08]manufacturing [ˌmænjuˈfæktʃərɪŋ]n. 制造业；制造，生产
[10:21.12]licence [ˈlaɪsns]n. 执照；许可证 搭 give full licence to do sth. 充分授权做某事
[10:27.72]sundry [ˈsʌndri]a. 各式各样的；杂的，杂项的 n. 杂货； 杂项 搭 all and sundry 每个人，所有人
[10:34.44]craft [krɑːft]vt. 精巧地制作 n. (需要手艺的)行业；行 会；工艺 例 A college adviser is giving a weekend tutorial on how to craft a well-rounded extracurricular portfolio. America's current account deficit is at a record high, yet the dollar has remained relatively strong.
[11:00.12]epitomise [ɪˈpɪtəmaɪz]vt. 概括；象征；使成为…的缩影 例 The meeting record epitomises all the topics we discussed.
